              "hideComponent": "false",
              "topMargin": "2",
              "jcr:created": "Fri Apr 04 2025 20:51:16 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>36<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">O</span>Max™</b> Laser Technology powers our super-bore access catheter platform, featuring thousands of laser cuts in a stainless steel hypotube.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The result? A large lumen, low-profile access catheter that delivers on trackability while maintaining lumen patency, kink resistance, and 8F closure compatibility.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">That's innovation in <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">action.</span></span></span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Thu May 01 2025 22:25:27 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
